Description:

Metadata and annotation changes are now reported: as MailboxMetadataChange,
ServerMetadataChange and AnnotationChange event notifications, through the
IMAP NOTIFY events of the same names (RFC 5465), as unsolicited METADATA
responses after ENABLE METADATA (RFC 5464), and as ANNOTATION items in
unsolicited FETCH responses after SELECT with the ANNOTATE parameter
(RFC 5257).


Documentation:

docsrc/concepts/features/event-notifications.rst, docsrc/rfc-support.rst


Config changes:

event_groups has a new ``metadata`` group, off by default.


Upgrade instructions:

To send these events to notifyd, add ``metadata`` to ``event_groups``.
The IMAP notifications need idled.


